#: toplevel.cpp:60
msgid ""
"The application finder looks for non-KDE applications on your system and "
"adds them to the KDE menu system. Click 'Scan' to begin, select the desired "
"applications and then click 'Apply'."
msgstr ""
"Namakar program pyta za programami na Wašim systemje a doda je do menijoweho "
"systema KDE. Klikńće 'pytać' za startowanje, wubjerće wotpowědne programy a "
"klikńće potom na 'nałožić'."

